## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Reset Filters Button in Light Mode Washed Out**: `.btn-reset-filters:hover` forced `color: #FFFFFF` on `var(--bg-elevated)`. In dark mode, `--bg-elevated` was `#2A475E` (readable), but in light mode, `--bg-elevated` was `#E1E8EF` (light gray), creating white text on light gray (~1.2:1 contrast). Fixed by adding dedicated Light Mode overrides with `#EFF6FF` background and `#0078D4` text.
- **Purchase Modal Manage Methods Link in Light Mode**: `.manage-methods-link:hover` set `color: #FFFFFF`. On a white modal surface, hovering inverted the text to white-on-white. Fixed with `:host-context([data-theme="light"]) .manage-methods-link:hover { color: #005A9E; }`.

---

