## Decisions Made

- **Theme-Aware Hover Backgrounds**: Buttons in Light Mode now transition to soft-tinted surfaces (`#EFF6FF`, `#F1F5F9`) with primary accent text (`#0078D4`, `#005A9E`), completely forbidding static `#FFFFFF` text on variable elevated backgrounds.
- **Strict Invariant Verification**: Added permanent assertions in `ui-ux-polish-stress.ts` (GF8) and `integration-tests.spec.ts` ensuring `.btn-reset-filters` light mode hover overrides cannot be inadvertently removed.
- **Canonical Tokens for Component Hosts**: `:host` containers across all routes derive background strictly from `var(--bg-void)` and text from `var(--text-primary)`.

